message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GEO & Schema Checker by taismo"
abstract: "Chrome extension that shows the schema graph, entity signals and AI readability of any web page in one click. It merges JSON-LD by @id, checks schema.org types, entity signals, robots.txt access for search and AI crawlers, llms.txt and SEO basics. All checks run locally in the browser."
